### SCENARIO: Request for unknown employee/location/policy combination
### No balance exists, so the dimension check fails

### Try to create a request for an employee with no balance record
# Expected: 422 INVALID_DIMENSIONS
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "unknown-emp",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "dimensions-001"
}

### Try with a known employee but unknown location
# Expected: 422 INVALID_DIMENSIONS
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "unknown-loc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "dimensions-002"
}
